{"articleNo":"2753","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2753&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011-1 학기제현장실습 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.02.07","hit":"11802","attachments":[{"name":"학기제현장실습운영지침.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2753&attachNo=1577"},{"name":"학기제현장실습신청서1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2753&attachNo=1588"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fr-view\"><!--StartFragment--><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: center;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움;\">2011학년도 1학기 학기제현장실습 신청 안내</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움;\">1. 이수대상 : 3학년 이상 재학생(재학중 1회에 한함)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움;\">2. 이수시기 : 해당 학기 내 실시</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움;\">3. 이수기간 : 15주 이상(법정근로시간)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움;\">4. 이수신청 : “학기제현장실습신청서”를 작성하여 해당 학부(과)에 제출</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;☞첨부 파일 참조</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%;\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline;\">5. 신청기간 : 2011. 2. 11(금)까지&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움;\">6. 대상업체(해당 학부 종합학사행정실 문의)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움;\">&nbsp; 가. 학교나 학부단위의 산학연계 결연업체</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt;\">&nbsp; 나. 학부장이 추천하는 전공과 관련이 있는 업체</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움;\">&nbsp; 다. 학부장이 추천하는 업체 이외에 학생이 선정하는 전공과 관련이 있는 업체</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%;\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline;\">7. 수강신청</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline;\">가. 주간수업은 신청할 수 없음</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline;\">나. 실습기관이 출퇴근 거리를 벗어난 경우 등은 야간에도 수강신청할 수 없음</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%;\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline;\">다. 실습대상자는 교무연구과에서 일괄 수강신청</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 75.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -75.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움;\">8. 성적처리 : 현장실습 합격자는 S, 불합격자는 U로 평가되며, U로 평가받은 성적은 기록하지 않음(교무과에서 일괄 성적 처리)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 81pt; TEXT-INDENT: -81pt;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움;\">9. 문의전화</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움;\">&nbsp;각 학부(과) 종합학사행정실 전화번호</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"16\" style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid;\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"102\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;;\">행정실명</span></p></td><td bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"16\" style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid;\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"321\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;;\">학부(과)명</span></p></td><td bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"16\" style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0